  "_comment": "Every species/form usable in Pokémon Champions Ranked as of Regulation M-C (9 Sep – 2 Dec 2026). Names are @smogon/calc species names (regional forms as -Alola/-Galar/-Hisui/-Paldea-*, Farfetch’d with a curly apostrophe). Source: Serebii's Champions 'Available Pokémon' roster, cross-checked against Game8 and MetaVGC M-C roster pages; forms Champions folds into one entry (Rotom appliances, Indeedee-F, Lycanroc forms, ...) are listed separately because they change stats/types. Megas are not listed here — they're reached via the Mega toggle. legal_items is the full held-item pool (Champions deliberately restricts items — no Choice Band/Specs, Assault Vest, Safety Goggles, Covert Cloak, Clear Amulet, Weakness Policy, Eviolite, Booster Energy…), from Serebii's Champions items page cross-checked against champdex.com; Mega Stones are omitted because the Mega toggle handles that. Regenerate both lists when the regulation changes. 'megas' maps a base species to its Mega forme(s) as engine names (some have two: Charizard X/Y, Raichu X/Y, Absol/Absol Z, Garchomp/Garchomp Z, Lucario/Lucario Z).",
